      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This isn't a VRChat issue, more a \"Steam has changed the bindings for this and you're stuck on the old ones\". Go into the controller settings for VRChat (in Steam) and hit default on all the sliders for grabbing, it should then be find. You can then tweak it to taste if required. Setting them to around 20 Force for me gave me what felt like the old setting back.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
