      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Huhu, so I went through the keybindings and tried stuff out. So basicly trying the suggestion from Enverex out was not the solution for me. as it still began to grab as soon as i put down 2 fingers. I wanted the real grip hold & grip release back (so i squeeze the controller to grab stuff). I was able to get this back by switching the values in the grabbing settings.\n\nYou can see this here:",
